{"title": "Murderous Retort", "pageid": 31380, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Murderous_Retort", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Class actions", "Reactions", "Legendary actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Main_Hand_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Main_Hand_Attack.webp/300px-Main_Hand_Attack.webp, /w/images/3/3d/Main_Hand_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Main_Hand_Attack.webp/300px-Main_Hand_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Main_Hand_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Murderous Retort</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary action\">Legendary Action</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarevok\">Sarevok</a> in Honour mode. It allows them to teleport to an attacker and immediately retaliate with an attack once per round. The attack is guaranteed to hit, regardless of <a href=\"/wiki/AC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AC\">AC</a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nImmediately strike back at an attacker. If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Legacy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\">Deathbringer's Legacy</a> is active, use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer's Assault</a> instead.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Sarevok</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Sarevok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Sarevok\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Sarevok</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Sarevok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Sarevok\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version that teleports to a distant attacker</div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Orin</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Orin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Melee_Orin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Orin</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Orin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Interrupt_LOW_BhaalsRetribution_Ranged_Orin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Version that teleports to a distant attacker</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort\" title=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort\" title=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort\">Legendary Action: Murderous Retort</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarevok\">Sarevok</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This reaction is triggered when <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarevok\">Sarevok</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> are affected by any hostile action, not merely by attacks.</li>\n<li>While not directly mentioned in the description, Sarevok and Orin will first teleport to distant attackers before making the retaliation strike. Additionally, the attack will always land if Dread Pursuit is used to teleport to the attacker.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063432\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2485/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37850/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14023/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1128499/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.688      1 -total\n 99.40%   58.334      1 Template:Feature_page\n 87.27%   51.219     35 Template:Trim\n 23.39%   13.728      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 11.99%    7.034      4 Template:Icon_text\n 11.72%    6.876      2 Template:Hidden_code